Chef and Chapters
This semester, Chef took X courses. Each course has Y units and each unit has Z chapters in it.Find the total number of chapters Chef has to study this semester.

input
3
1 1 1
2 1 2
1 2 3

output
1
4
6

=====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    x,y,z=map(int,input().split())
    print(x*y*z)
